   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "陰陽二遁分順逆，一氣三元人莫測。五日都來接一元，接氣超神為準則。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 3,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "認取九宮為九星，八門又逐九宮行。九宮逢甲為直符，八門值使自分明。符上之門為直使，十時一易堪憑據。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 4,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六甲元號六儀名，三奇即是乙丙丁。陽遁順儀奇逆布，陰遁逆儀奇順行。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
