   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "蓬任衝輔禽陽星，英芮柱心陰宿名。輔禽心星為上吉，衝任小吉未全亨。大凶蓬芮不堪使，小凶英柱不精明。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 30,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "八門若遇開休生，諸事逢之總趁情。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 31,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "若死門何所主，只宜弔死與行刑。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 32,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "生門六丙合六丁，此為天遁自分明。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 33,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "開門六乙合六己，地遁如斯而已矣。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 34,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "休門六丁共太陰，欲求人遁無過此。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 35,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "丙加甲兮鳥跌穴，甲加丙兮龍返首。只此二者是吉神，為事如意十八九。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 37,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六庚加丙白入熒，六丙加庚熒入白。白入熒兮賊即來，熒入白兮賊即去。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 38,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六庚加丙白入熒，六丙加庚熒入白。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 39,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六癸加丁蛇夭矯，六丁加癸雀投江。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 40,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六丁加癸雀投江。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 41,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六乙加辛龍逃走，六辛加乙虎猖狂。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 42,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六辛加乙虎猖狂。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 43,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "六儀擊刑何太凶，甲子值符愁向東。戌刑未上申刑虎，寅巳辰辰午刑午。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 44,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "三奇入墓宜細推。丙奇屬火火墓戌，此時諸事不宜為。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 45,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "五不遇時龍不精，號為日月損光明。時干來剋日干上，甲日須知時忌庚。",
   "supports": true,
   "weight": 1.0
  },
  {
   "edge_id": 46,
   "source_type": "corpus_extracted",
   "source_ref": "zhouyi-v2/gushu/yanbo-diaosou-ge/全文",
   "snippet": "與我同行即為，我生之月誠為旺。廢於父母休於財，囚於鬼兮真不妄。",
   "supports": true,
